cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If GlassBridge or AGX contributes to your research, please cite this software
  and the exact commit or release used.
title: GlassBridge / AGX
type: software
authors:
  - name: HumanCTO
repository-code: https://github.com/humancto/glass-bridge
url: https://humancto.github.io/glass-bridge/
version: 0.1.0-pre-alpha
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A pre-alpha research prototype for verifiable optical file exchange across
  controlled, disconnected boundaries using signed, policy-bound AGX envelopes,
  receiver-local quarantine, and auditable release evidence. Physical
  phone-camera performance and high-assurance air-gap deployment remain
  unproven evaluation targets.
keywords:
  - air gap
  - optical data transfer
  - secure file transfer
  - systems security
  - visible light communication
